  "initialization_policy": "Step 2A: overlap-aware localization. Same tensors, same V/H/A heads, same TRAIN-only ignore shield and VFL recipe; the only change is adding a GIoU term on the already-pooled ROI box regression so a box that is 0.40-0.50 IoU with its target is directly penalized. No second ROIAlign, no new parameters, strict load from validated_002304. Four joint PApple epochs, 1024 evaluation scale. The DFL distribution head is deliberately excluded: it adds parameters, so it cannot start from a strictly loaded checkpoint and would reset the only box regressor. No result is claimed before complete 814-image VAL and H-Flip TTA.",
